{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1223095-creating-a-community-of-writers-for-exalted-sourcebooks","id":1223095,"title":"Creating a community of writers for Exalted sourcebooks","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Exalted"],"posts":[{"date":"2018-05-29T20:07:31-07:00","id":1223095,"title":"<img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/icons/icon1.png\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" alt=\"\" /> Creating a community of writers for Exalted sourcebooks","content":"On a recent Pathcast episode Dixie mentioned that writers for Exalted were needed. Contributing in some way to help more Exalted books come to fruition would be a dream come true for me. My writing skills are, in my estimation, nowhere near performing at a professional level. There may be many others who frequent this forum who feel the same way. It is my hope that anyone who is interested in developing our skills work together. I am putting out an offer to edit pieces that conform to the <a href=\"http://theonyxpath.com/submission-guidelines/\" target=\"_blank\">submission guidlines.</a> The <a href=\"http://drive.google.com/file/d/0B7FqViticwNuVXZUZzRkQkcyRFU/view\" target=\"_blank\">style guide</a> will be used. Ideally, this will create &quot;cleaner&quot; submissions to Onyx Path. Those who evaluate submissions might have an easier job. As the cliche goes &quot;practice makes perfect.&quot; The more we write/edit the better we get.<br /> <br /> I am not affiliated with Onyx Path/White Wolf in any way other than being a fan. Any advice given or changes suggested will be my own. My &quot;approval&quot; does not indicate that the employees of Onyx Path will concur with my assessments.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24260-benk625","name":"benk625","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24260_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"7"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-05-29T21:19:12-07:00","id":1223103,"title":"","content":"Go for it. Good Luck<br /> <br /> I'd love to contribute odds and ends myself<br /> <br /> <br /> But I lack creativity and sufficient familiarity with the hard crunch to do so","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1047-vampire-hunter-d","name":"vampire hunter D","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1047_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1727"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-05-30T00:21:06-07:00","id":1223131,"title":"","content":"Hey cool idea, once midterms are done you might be able to expect something from me.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1121-drlovemonkey","name":"DrLoveMonkey","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1121_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4736"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-05-30T00:37:34-07:00","id":1223132,"title":"","content":"*hums* I tried to submit to write for Exalted before. Never heard back, not even with a denial. Dunno if I mucked up the submission, the formatting, the digital signature... or if my work was just that damn horrible. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/frown.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Frown\" smilieid=\"11\" class=\"inlineimg\" /><br /> <br /> I may join you. But I'll need to think it over","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4086-croakamancer","name":"Croakamancer","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4086_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"490"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-05-30T03:27:42-07:00","id":1223149,"title":"","content":"was that under the current dev team? or a previous regime?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1047-vampire-hunter-d","name":"vampire hunter D","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1047_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1727"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-05-30T07:25:02-07:00","id":1223227,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Croakamancer</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1223095-creating-a-community-of-writers-for-exalted-sourcebooks?p=1223132#post1223132\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">*hums* I tried to submit to write for Exalted before. Never heard back, not even with a denial. Dunno if I mucked up the submission, the formatting, the digital signature... or if my work was just that damn horrible. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/frown.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Frown\" smilieid=\"11\" class=\"inlineimg\" /></div> </div> </div> </div>I recently heard back that I need to submit the paperwork on the disclosure release for each submission, not just the first submission - so resubmit with paperwork if you were working under that assumption. <br /> <br /> I, too, have not heard back about contracted work or the denial of such specifically. However, I'm told this is not unusual from Rose Bailey as of March 2017. The answers are not a binary 'accept or reject' process, they hire as each project spins up. <br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://drive.google.com/file/d/10wrFXvyXnNjaFJ0XrHdIwce6rnG__0k9/view?usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\">Sidereal Jumpstart</a> (3e fanwork Charmset)<br /> <a href=\"https://drive.google.com/file/d/1DQXwMXm8G1IEYLl-SmuFgKGugeZxQL63/view?usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\">Cascades</a> (the above in flowchart form)","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1103-tikor","name":"Tikor","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1103_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"826"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-05-30T07:27:30-07:00","id":1223228,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>vampire hunter D</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1223095-creating-a-community-of-writers-for-exalted-sourcebooks?p=1223103#post1223103\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Go for it. Good Luck<br /> <br /> I'd love to contribute odds and ends myself<br /> <br /> <br /> But I lack creativity and sufficient familiarity with the hard crunch to do so</div> </div> </div> </div>I wouldn't mind help with editing.<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24260-benk625","name":"benk625","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24260_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"7"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-05-30T07:33:01-07:00","id":1223233,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Croakamancer</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1223095-creating-a-community-of-writers-for-exalted-sourcebooks?p=1223132#post1223132\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">*hums* I tried to submit to write for Exalted before. Never heard back, not even with a denial. Dunno if I mucked up the submission, the formatting, the digital signature... or if my work was just that damn horrible. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/frown.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Frown\" smilieid=\"11\" class=\"inlineimg\" /><br /> <br /> I may join you. But I'll need to think it over</div> </div> </div> </div>I can always take a look at your first submission and see if it matches the style guide.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24260-benk625","name":"benk625","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24260_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":